  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The maximum angular velocity of the stone is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>The tension in the string will provide the required centripetal force. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>l</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mn>30</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>360000</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn></math></p>",
